{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_03B000","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Amanda，回村子只能经过那个三岔路口吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"好像有条近路。回到咖啡工厂入口后，走右边那条路。可以直接回村子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"另外，那一带的警戒可能已经加强了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"毕竟刚才对付坦克闹得挺大。那么，回到村子后该怎么办？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"把村子北侧的路障炸掉。从那里就能接上他们的运输路线。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"炸掉路障……得用C4……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":35,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"一旦爆破，敌人肯定不会坐视不管。警戒是躲不过了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"走狭窄的小巷，也许能避开他们的视线。要是能翻过围栏就好了。炸掉路障以后也别大意。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""}]}